# Build-time Python dependencies of flipperone-mcu-firmware, installed into the bundled
# interpreter. Keep these pins equal to the firmware's build requirements; a firmware
# change to them needs a toolchain release first. Regenerate the lock with:
#   uv pip compile python/requirements-build.in --universal --python-version 3.12 \
#     --generate-hashes --exclude-newer <date two weeks ago> -o python/requirements.lock
